WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.810
What is three quarters of 20?

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:05.010
First find one quarter.

00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:07.710
Share 20 into 4 equal groups.

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:09.650
Each group is 5.

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:12.230
Three quarters is 3 of those groups.

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:14.016
15.
